   $q$The writer wants to add evidence after sentence (6) to support the reason in sentence (4). Which sentence is most relevant?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The art room at Lakeview was painted a bright new shade of blue last summer.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-detail"},{"text":"In a survey of Lakeview art students, 75 percent said the class helped them manage deadlines in other subjects.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Music class can be loud, so it meets in a separate wing of the building.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-detail"},{"text":"Some well-known musicians never took a single music class while they were in school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"undermines-claim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In a survey of Lakeview art students, 75 percent said the class helped them manage deadlines in other subjects.$q$, $q$Sentence (4) claims the arts teach skills useful in every subject, and the survey shows art students applying deadline skills elsewhere. The sentence about musicians who skipped music class actually works against the writer's claim.$q$, 'draft', '5a32dc42-4e7d-5d98-8542-caa08b12437e')
