insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('2c1c5fe1-990b-5703-b855-06cc11dca4c9', 'wg8-argument-writing-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Intramurals for Everyone$q$, $q$(1) At Pinecrest Middle School, only about sixty students make the competitive sports teams each year. (2) Hundreds of other students who enjoy sports have no chance to play at school. (3) Pinecrest should create an intramural program that lets any student join a team, regardless of skill. (4) Intramurals would help more students stay active. (5) Health experts recommend that young people get about an hour of physical activity each day, but many students sit for most of the afternoon. (6) Intramurals also teach teamwork. (7) Players learn to communicate, share responsibilities, and support one another. (8) Basketball was invented in the winter of 1891 as an indoor game.

(9) Coaches of the competitive teams worry that intramurals would compete for gym time. (10) This is a fair concern. (11) Intramural games could be scheduled during lunch or on mornings before school, when the gym sits empty.

(12) Every student who wants to play deserves a team, and an intramural program would give them one.$q$, 'draft')
