   $q$A student titles a story "the secret of the silver canyon." Which words in the title should begin with a capital letter?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The, Secret, Silver, Canyon","is_correct":true},{"text":"The, Secret, Of, The, Silver, Canyon","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"short-words-capitalized"},{"text":"Secret, Silver, Canyon","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"first-word-lowercased"},{"text":"The, Silver, Canyon","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"important-word-missed"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The, Secret, Silver, Canyon$q$, $q$In a title, the first word and all important words are capitalized, while short words like "of" and a "the" that is not first stay lowercase. Capitalizing every word, including "of," is the common mistake.$q$, 'draft', null)
