   $q$Sentences 7, 8 and 10 mainly serve to:$q$, $q$[{"text":"give examples that support sentence 6","is_correct":true},{"text":"define the term \"tide pool\" for readers","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-paragraph-focus"},{"text":"explain how and why ocean tides form","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"describe the writer's own visit to the coast","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"invents-narrative"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$give examples that support sentence 6$q$, $q$Sentence 6 says each animal has its own way of coping, and sentences 7, 8 and 10 each show one animal's way. The term "tide pool" is defined in paragraph 1, not by these sentences.$q$, 'draft', 'cebac371-d25d-53f5-b352-64c69ef72ab0')
