insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('07a8501f-fef4-5e95-8e0d-e51beaec2332', 'wg8-narrative-writing-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-narrative-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$The Solo$q$, $q$(1) Tariq had practiced the cello solo for the spring concert every night for a month. (2) He knew every note by heart. (3) But when Ms. Lindqvist announced that the solo would be performed in front of the whole school, his stomach dropped. (4) The concert is in the auditorium. (5) On the night of the concert, Tariq waited backstage with the rest of the orchestra.

(6) Tariq walked onto the stage. (7) The lights were bright and hot. (8) He sat down, set his bow on the strings, and began to play. (9) His first note came out thin and shaky. (10) Somewhere in the audience, a chair squeaked. (11) He closed his eyes and pictured his bedroom, where he had played the solo thirty times without a single mistake. (12) The next note came out full and warm. (13) He played the rest of the piece. (14) When he lifted his bow, the auditorium was silent for one long second. (15) Then the applause began.

(16) Afterward, Tariq felt good.$q$, 'draft')
