   $q$Which sentence should be deleted because it adds no new information and shifts into present tense?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence 2","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-detail"},{"text":"sentence 9","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-turning-point"},{"text":"sentence 4","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence 11","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence 4$q$, $q$Sentence 4 uses "is" in a story told in past tense, and the auditorium is mentioned later anyway. Sentence 9 must stay because the shaky note is the problem Tariq has to overcome.$q$, 'draft', '07a8501f-fef4-5e95-8e0d-e51beaec2332')
