   $q$What is the main purpose of sentence 10 in the narrative?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It marks a jump in time to the moment after the concert has ended.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-sequence"},{"text":"It shows that people are leaving the concert because the solo is going badly.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It adds a small, realistic sound that increases the tension right after the shaky note.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It introduces a new character who will become important later in the story.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It adds a small, realistic sound that increases the tension right after the shaky note.$q$, $q$The squeak comes right after Tariq's shaky first note and makes the silent room feel tense and noticeable. Nothing in the text says anyone is leaving, so that choice goes beyond the evidence.$q$, 'draft', '07a8501f-fef4-5e95-8e0d-e51beaec2332')
