   $q$Which revision of sentence 9 best uses dialogue to show Kofi's fear?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"Let go whenever you want,\" he said in a calm voice.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-character"},{"text":"He yelled something at me that I could not really hear.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vague-summary"},{"text":"He told me that he wanted me to keep holding on to the seat.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"summary-not-dialogue"},{"text":"\"Don't let go!\" he shouted. \"Don't you dare let go!\"","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"Don't let go!" he shouted. "Don't you dare let go!"$q$, $q$Kofi's repeated, shouted words let the reader hear his fear directly. The choice "He told me that he wanted me to keep holding on to the seat" reports what he wanted instead of giving his actual words.$q$, 'draft', '2f9c1c80-8172-5c78-8880-5a3902b5cacf')
