   $q$Which revision of sentence 7 best connects the second paragraph to the first?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Some people in the neighborhood did not like the mural when it was first finished.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-claim"},{"text":"Painting is a relaxing hobby that many retired people enjoy in their free time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-fact"},{"text":"The project changed more than the tunnel, because it also changed the people who painted it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The painters used brushes, rollers and ladders to reach the top of the walls.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The project changed more than the tunnel, because it also changed the people who painted it.$q$, $q$The choice "The project changed more than the tunnel" links back to the tunnel's change in paragraph 1 and introduces the new point about the painters. Nothing in the draft says people disliked the mural, so that sentence adds an unsupported claim.$q$, 'draft', '0c42a82c-b490-5e05-a750-5b0850d2b59a')
