   $q$The writer wants to add a detail that supports sentence 2. Which detail from the article would work best?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Mensah explains that the study took place during the fall cross-country season.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"weak-link-to-claim"},{"text":"Mensah explains that many young runners like to listen to music during long runs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Mensah explains that hard runs cause tiny tears in muscle fibers, which heal and thicken on rest days.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Mensah explains that running shoes should be replaced after a few hundred miles of use.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Mensah explains that hard runs cause tiny tears in muscle fibers, which heal and thicken on rest days.$q$, $q$Sentence 2 says muscles grow stronger during rest, and the detail about fibers healing and thickening on rest days explains how. When the study took place does not show anything about how muscles grow.$q$, 'draft', '8ca33250-10a4-57a2-af28-2f3bad0a991c')
